          "angle": 180
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "relationship-handles-as-graph-structure"
        },
        "markdown": "## Read this as an authoring-model question\n\nA **Port** supplies the named handles that express its important relationships. A **Declaration** participates through the same mechanism instead of receiving unexplained legacy side handles.\n\nThe candidate `primary-view` handle names the landing surface. Whether Declaration also needs an ordinary `root` port remains deliberately open."
      }
    },
